name: workloads-audit
description: |
  Audits the namespace's workload controllers — Deployments,
  StatefulSets, DaemonSets, Jobs and the pods they own. Reports
  restart loops, unready replicas, missing probes, missing resource
  limits and mutable image tags. Read-only.
mode: Task
# Cheap tier: reading one slice of one namespace is not where this
